<title>USA: FINAL PRICING - Nashville and Davidson Co., Tenn.</title>
<headline>FINAL PRICING - Nashville and Davidson Co., Tenn.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>J.C. Bradford &amp; Co said it priced $34.515 million of Nashville and Davidson County Metropolitan Government, Tenn., general obligation refunding bonds, Series 1996 with a top yield of 5.10 percent in 2010.</p>
